      "value": "Summary of findings so far:\nAWS us-west-2 VPN to JP region: 220ms\nAWS us-west-1 VPN to JP region: 200ms\nMozilla VPN New York City to JP region: 255ms (this suggests that NYC has better latency to JP, but not enough to overcome the seattle-NYC latency)\nMozilla VPN Los Angeles to JP: 150ms\nMozilla VPN Japan to JP: 100ms",
