  "details": "From my home ISP (condointernet/wave, ASN 11404), I get an in-client ping of about 250 ms to the JP region and 39 to the US region. However, when using mozilla VPN I get a ping of about 100 to JP and ~210 to US. This suggests some suboptimal routing along the path between my ISP and your region servers.\nI'll get a traceroute later tonight after I figure out what IPs you're using for regional servers.",
